WEBVTT

1
00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:45.630
I'll be outside.

2
00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:49.166
I'll take off your shirt
to see what you got.

3
00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:51.590
All right?

4
00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:17.110
I looked up to your father.

5
00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:22.350
He and my big brother

6
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:25.590
were like two heroes to me.

7
00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:34.350
Your grandfather
should end up as they did.

8
00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:41.046
When my nephew told me
what you were doing...

9
00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:43.630
I was afraid for you.

10
00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:55.710
But now...

11
00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:59.710
the war has started.

12
00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:03.990
We have to finish it.

13
00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:18.950
I'm nearly done.

14
00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:43.630
Give me your arm.

15
00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:55.550
Change the bandage twice a day.

16
00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:58.670
And rest.

17
00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:04.350
Take these after every meal
or it'll get infected.

18
00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:07.550
Thank you.

19
00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.990
There's a lot of people

20
00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:18.110
counting on you.

21
00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:22.110
I hope you know what you're doing.

22
00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.566
I do.

23
00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:27.630
I'm going to see Italo.

24
00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:48.710
Hello?

25
00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:51.286
Baby. where are you?

26
00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:54.766
Listen. things went wrong. You gotta run.

27
00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:58.006
Take Mico and find my grandfather.
Do what he says.

28
00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.550
Your grandfather?

29
00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:03.750
Stefano. what happened?

30
00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:10.550
How did it go?

31
00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.910
Good.

32
00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:20.390
How did he say he got shot?

33
00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:26.350
He didn't tell me. why?

34
00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:31.030
Because they didn't shoot him.

35
00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:36.150
He shot himself.

36
00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:41.926
Peace.

37
00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:46.190
My name's Omar. I'm a friend
of Mohamed Hamaha.

38
00:09:47.510 --> 00:09:51.430
Mohamed was killed
by the French yesterday.

39
00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.926
Who are they?

40
00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:57.406
Americans.

41
00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:00.390
I'm sorry about Mohamed.

42
00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:03.310
I don't like Americans.

43
00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:37.350
- Bring them a blanket.
- Okay.

44
00:11:53.550 --> 00:11:56.550
For the cold.

45
00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:28.406
Peace be with you.

46
00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:30.606
- How's it going?
- Well and you?

47
00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.070
Well.

48
00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:51.150
Let's go.

49
00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:56.310
Peace.

50
00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.950
Get out.

51
00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:03.566
Easy.

52
00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:05.670
Easy.

53
00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:15.710
Tell her to go back in the car!

54
00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.550
- Stay in the car!
- Easy.

55
00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:55.790
Easy. easy.

56
00:17:56.310 --> 00:17:58.486
You stay in the car.

57
00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:02.070
Stay in the car! Stay there!

58
00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:03.606
Where's my brother?

59
00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:05.870
Do you speak French?

60
00:21:53.990 --> 00:21:58.526
Breaking news: there's been another
terrorist attack in Ouagadougo.

61
00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:02.326
where a handful of extremists
are holding dozens of people hostage

62
00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:06.550
in a hotel in the heart of the city.

63
00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:09.886
Gunfire was heard close to the hotel

64
00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:14.886
but there is no information
regarding casualties.

65
00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:19.830
Authorities have not received any
demands for the release of the hostages.

66
00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:23.886
One of the attackers
has been identified as Tamil Yiarango.

67
00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:25.686
son of militant Brahim Yiarango.

68
00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:28.126
We have not yet established

69
00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:32.006
whether Yiarango senior
is one of the attackers.

70
00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:36.350
Over to Bernard Erting
at the scene of the attack.

71
00:22:36.390 --> 00:22:39.006
The attack was carried out
by four armed men

72
00:22:39.030 --> 00:22:41.886
who opened fire
on a crowded French restaurant.

73
00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:45.830
The patrons
were brought into the hotel...

74
00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:32.566
There's been an attack!

75
00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:35.870
French Special Forces.

76
00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:42.446
They're all dead.

77
00:23:42.470 --> 00:23:45.350
Everyone is dead.

78
00:25:29.550 --> 00:25:31.990
Go.

79
00:25:33.230 --> 00:25:36.150
Careful. Check.

80
00:25:48.590 --> 00:25:50.966
No men on the left.

81
00:25:50.990 --> 00:25:53.470
Go. go!

82
00:26:03.470 --> 00:26:05.910
Wait.

83
00:26:09.390 --> 00:26:11.830
Go check.

84
00:26:12.710 --> 00:26:15.550
About six men.

85
00:26:17.710 --> 00:26:20.110
Okay. go.

86
00:27:37.790 --> 00:27:40.310
Press hard.

87
00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:46.550
Press hard. Like this.

88
00:29:58.590 --> 00:30:01.350
Wear this tonight.

89
00:30:05.470 --> 00:30:09.110
I wore it in when I married your mother.

90
00:30:28.190 --> 00:30:31.430
You are my favourite son.

91
00:30:34.030 --> 00:30:36.910
Say goodbye to mother for me.

92
00:33:54.510 --> 00:33:58.526
He's an American doctor
with World Peace Doctors.

93
00:33:58.550 --> 00:34:01.350
He has to examine some patients.

94
00:34:04.390 --> 00:34:08.070
- Good evening.
- Your access permit.

95
00:34:19.350 --> 00:34:22.670
Are you Dr. Christopher Lynwood?

96
00:34:24.830 --> 00:34:28.510
- And these men are with you?
- Yes.

97
00:35:39.630 --> 00:35:42.190
You've come.

98
00:35:45.550 --> 00:35:48.390
Who is he?

99
00:35:50.750 --> 00:35:53.950
Let me see my new baby.

100
00:35:55.710 --> 00:35:58.710
Where's Tamil?

101
00:36:04.550 --> 00:36:07.390
He's on his way to God.

102
00:36:17.870 --> 00:36:20.830
God is great.

103
00:36:21.590 --> 00:36:24.670
There is no other God but Allah.

104
00:36:36.630 --> 00:36:39.190
Water.

105
00:37:07.910 --> 00:37:10.190
Here.

106
00:44:45.950 --> 00:44:49.270
Let's go!

107
00:44:49.310 --> 00:44:53.150
- What's he doing here?
- He was with them.

108
00:44:57.630 --> 00:44:59.806
Hurry! Quick!

109
00:44:59.830 --> 00:45:03.390
Don't let Brahim die!

110
00:45:09.630 --> 00:45:12.510
Get him inside.

111
00:45:13.030 --> 00:45:16.590
You. beat it!

112
00:45:17.470 --> 00:45:20.710
Beat it! Go on. beat it!
